        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>动画设计作品集 — 艺术留学</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #d6d6d6;\n    padding: 14px 12px 10px 12px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .brand {\n    font-size: 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #b9bcc0;\n    border: 1px solid #9a9da1;\n    color: #33383d;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Top zone : left text column + hero image ---------- */\n  .top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    width: 118px;\n    flex: 0 0 118px;\n  }\n  .num {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    line-height: 0.9;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .sec-title {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .hero {\n    position: relative;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    height: 218px;\n  }\n  .hero .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .hero-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 118px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 62px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Yellow banner ---------- */\n  .banner {\n    background: #fff200;\n    border: 3px solid #111;\n    margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\n    padding: 6px 4px 8px 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .banner h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 44px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n  }\n  .banner-sub {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #e8342a;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.5px #7a0f0a;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .ata-mini {\n    font-size: 7px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Lower zone : 3 columns ---------- */\n  .lower {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .lc { flex: 0 0 118px; }\n  .mc { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .rc { flex: 0 0 128px; }\n\n  .item-title {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 1px 0;\n  }\n  .item-en {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 7.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .item-body {\n    font-size: 6.3px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .blue { color: #1d4ed8; }\n  .mt { margin-top: 8px; }\n\n  /* sticker */\n  .sticker-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .cat {\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f2b8c6;\n    border: 2px solid #fff;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 2px solid #111;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"brand\">ATA&nbsp;&nbsp;CREATIVITY&nbsp;&nbsp;GLOBAL</div>\n\n  <!-- ===== TOP ZONE ===== -->\n  <div class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">动画作品集<br>介绍</div>\n      <div class=\"body-text\">\n        设计专业留学申请过程中最核心的申请材料之一 [illegible] 院校主要通过作品集考查学生的申请资质和专业能力,通常设计能力、创新意识、艺术修养和逻辑思维。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 海边小镇插画 / 灯塔与山景 — 顶部主图]</div>\n      <div class=\"hero-title\">艺术留学</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== YELLOW BANNER ===== -->\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <h1>动画设计作品集</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"banner-sub\">作品集要求/创作流程/调研方法</div>\n  <div class=\"ata-mini\">ATA</div>\n\n  <!-- ===== LOWER ZONE ===== -->\n  <div class=\"lower\">\n\n    <!-- left column -->\n    <div class=\"lc\">\n      <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">动画作品集<br>要求</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:118px;height:140px;margin-top:60px;\">\n        [Illustration: 五位角色人物立绘 — 左下角]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- middle column -->\n    <div class=\"mc\">\n      <div class=\"item-title\">调研能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item-en\">EVIDENCE OF RESEARCH<br>SKILLS</div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        学生需要通过研究影视动画以及相关的技术与图像内容,思考确定自己的项目作品设计想法和视觉计元素,为后期的设计打好理论基础。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sticker-row\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder cat\">[Sticker: 猫咪贴纸]</div>\n        <div class=\"tag\">建议收藏</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:88px;\">\n        [Image: 室内线稿场景 — 中列]\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item-title mt\">故事设计能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item-en\">STORYTELLING SKILLS</div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        学生需要根据前期的调研分析作品的原创动画自己所选择想要的的表现主题及内容,故事情节需要合理性,故事线索、故事要有节奏感、感染力,以及学生自己精彩讲的动画思路。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- right column -->\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <div class=\"item-title blue\">前期概念设</div>\n      <div class=\"item-title blue\">计能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item-en\">CONCEPT<br>DESIGNING</div>\n\n      <div class=\"item-title blue mt\">专业技能</div>\n      <div class=\"item-en\">TECHNICAL<br>SKILLS</div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        学生需要掌握设计动画的专业技能:绘画、软件驱稿、动画制作的合成、三维和二维动画形式的动画的作品能力,掌握能够帮助本院学生素质的表达学 生项目中的能力。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:74px;margin-top:6px;\">\n        [Image: 家具/椅子线稿 — 右列]\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item-title blue mt\">交流表达能力</div>\n      <div class=\"item-en\">COMMUNICATION<br>SKILLS</div>\n      <div class=\"item-body\">\n        学生需要通过清晰的视觉效果、精练 的语言在呈现上展示自己的作品。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- bottom row images -->\n  <div class=\"lower\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">\n    <div class=\"lc\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mc\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:78px;\">[Image: 室外动画场景 — 底部中列]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rc\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%;height:78px;\">[Image: 室内桌面/显示器场景 — 底部右列]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
